From 65a8c2d6c7d2e606b6b0fc34f01228b2388c002c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Justin <justurn@live.com>
Date: Tue, 13 Oct 2026 01:24:09 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat: rogue opens with Backstab from stealth, from behind
 (F-219)

- WorldObject.o: the unit's facing
- KillRequest opener_spell/opener_auras: while one of the auras (Stealth)
  is on us and the target has not noticed us, walk to 2 yd behind it
  (opposite its facing), face it and open with the spell; else skipped
- runner: a rogue with a dagger in the main hand opens with its best
  Backstab rank; it stealths before planned kills as well as trips

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_019SSuH6gpqY4Kn5Rk9sd149
